{"strongs": "H8068", "word": "שָׁמִיר", "translit": "sha.mir", "root": "שמר", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "thorn(s), adamant, flint", "definition": "I. שָׁמִיר noun masculine : Ezek 3:9 thorn(s), adamant, flint ; — absolute ׳ שׁ Isa 5:6 +; suffix שְׁמִירוֺ Isa 10:17 — 1. collective thorns, thorn-bushes , token of waste-land, only Isaiah, + שַׁיִת Isa 5:6 ; Isa 7:23 ; Isa 7:24 ; Isa 7:25 ; Isa 27:4 figurative Isa 9:17 ; Isa 10:17 ׳ קוֺץ שׁ Isa 32:13 . 2. adamant , as sharp, כְּתוּבָה ֗֗֗ בְּצִפֹּרֶן ׳ שׁ Jer 17:1 (|| בְּעֵט בַּדְוֶל ); as hard, figurative of prophet's firmness Ezek 3:9 ; Zech 7:12 figurative of hard heart.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8870')\">BDB8870</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8068')\">H8068</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8869')\">BDB8869</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8871')\">BDB8871</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>שָׁמִיר</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b>: <ref ref=\"Ezek 3:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,3,9)\">Ezek 3:9</ref> <highlightword>thorn(s), adamant, flint</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,6)\">Isa 5:6</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>שְׁמִירוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 10:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,17)\">Isa 10:17</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> collective <highlight>thorns, thorn-bushes</highlight>, token of waste-land, only Isaiah, + <bdbheb>שַׁיִת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,6)\">Isa 5:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 7:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,23)\">Isa 7:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 7:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,24)\">Isa 7:24</